33	 * of one handler during one integration step, with references to the
34	 * state at the end of the preceding step. This information is used to
35	 * decide if the handler should trigger an event or not during the
36	 * proposed step (and hence the step should be reduced to ensure the
37	 * event occurs at a bound rather than inside the step).</p>
